.SH DESCRIPTION
The \f[B]umami\f[R] library implements a log anomaly\-detection
algorithm as a self\-contained Rust crate.
.PP
It is designed to be embedded in log\-processing pipelines.
The high\-level entry point is \f[B]Detector\f[R], which manages
per\-system state.
Lower\-level building blocks (tokenizer, signature, profile) are also
exposed for custom pipelines.
.PP
The library forbids unsafe code and has no required runtime
dependencies.
